//// The `onze-og` package — module-tree root.
////
//// `ImageResponse` — style parse, layout, SVG and the rasterizer
//// port. erlang only: SVG → PNG leaves the VM through a port.
////
//// A skeleton created by front 95 (`specs/1.0.10-beta/06-onze/modules.md`
//// § The cut): an empty `pub` surface and one inline test, so the member is a
//// row of `zig build test-libs` from the first commit. Owner: front 70.

test "onze-og: the member compiles and runs on its rows" {
    assert "onze-og".length() == 7;
}
